# Character-set and line-ending policy.
#
# The source is stored UTF-8/ASCII with LF and must stay readable by
# z/OS compilers when tagged. Do not mark anything "identity": an
# untagged file on z/OS is read as EBCDIC.
#
# There is no chtag helper in this repo yet; tagging is the installer's
# job (see docs/zos-changes.md). A file's character set is its tag,
# never its bytes.
*           text=auto eol=lf
*.c         text eol=lf
*.h         text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
configure   text eol=lf
Makefile.in text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore  text eol=lf
